{"action": "add", "accountId": "acct_31c623c5709b451b996c500c", "articles": [{"articleType": "news", "title": "Claude 砍掉 80% 系统提示词之后：上下文工程的新规则", "author": "ZIIKOO TALK", "digest": "Anthropic 砍掉 Claude Code 80% 系统提示还不掉分——六条旧神话作废，附今晚可执行的 CLAUDE.md / Skill 精简清单。", "content": "<div id=\"output\">\n<section class=\"container\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin-top: 0 !important;\">你打开 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">CLAUDE.md</code>，又加了三条规矩：</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">「不要写注释」「必须写注释」「按文档写注释。」</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">同一条对话里，系统提示、Skill、用户需求互相打架。模型不是笨，是被你绑住了。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Anthropic Claude Code 团队的 Thariq 最近写了一篇很长的复盘：在 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Claude Opus 5 / Claude Fable 5</strong> 这代模型上，他们把 Claude Code 系统提示词砍掉了 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">超过 80%</strong>，编码评测几乎没有掉分。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">结论很刺耳，也很实用：</p><blockquote class=\"blockquote\" style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">以前靠规则拴住模型；现在要学会松绑，把判断权还回去。</strong></p></blockquote><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">下面按原文把「旧神话 → 新规则」拆开，并落成你今晚就能改的清单。</p><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\"><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">一、30 秒说清发生了什么</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">你发给 Claude 的那句 prompt，只是上下文的一小块。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">真正撑起一整次会话的，还有：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">System Prompt</strong>（产品级行为）</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Skills</strong>（按需加载的能力说明）</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">CLAUDE.md</strong>（仓库约定与坑）</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Memory / Artifacts / 引用文件</strong></li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Anthropic 把这套组装工作叫 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Context Engineering（上下文工程）</strong>。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">它和单次 prompt 最大的不同：\\ <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">上下文会被反复复用，不能写得太具体。</strong><br>你必须在「足够通用」和「足够有用」之间找平衡——而模型能力一变，平衡点就得跟着变。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">他们在内部 transcript 里看到的典型事故不是模型不懂，而是：</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">同一请求里同时出现「按情况补文档」和「绝对不要加注释」。<br>Claude 往往仍能猜对用户意图，但得先在冲突指令里多绕一圈。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">旧模型时代，这些硬约束是为了避免删文件、乱写注释之类的最坏情况。<br>新模型判断力上来之后，<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">很多护栏可以删，让模型读周围代码自己做决定。</strong></p><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\"><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">二、六个「以前 vs 现在」</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">这是全文最值得截图的部分。</p>\n        <section style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left; max-width: 100%; overflow: auto;\">\n          <table class=\"preview-table\" style=\"color: #3f3f3f; margin-top: 0 !important;\">\n            <thead style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #3f3f3f;\"><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">以前（已成神话）</th><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">现在（Claude 5 代）</th></thead>\n            <tbody><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">给 Claude 立规矩</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">让 Claude 用判断力</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">堆使用示例</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">把工具接口设计好</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">所有信息一股脑塞前面</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">渐进披露，用到再加载</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">同一条指令重复写</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">工具描述写清就够</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">记忆写进 CLAUDE.md</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">自动记忆</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">简单 Markdown 规格书</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">更丰富的引用（代码、HTML、评分标准）</td></tr></tbody>\n          </table>\n        </section>\n      <h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">1）规矩 → 判断</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">旧系统提示里有过这种强度：</p><blockquote class=\"blockquote\" style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;\">默认不写注释；不要写多段 docstring；不要主动写规划/分析文档……</p></blockquote><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">在一部分任务上这是对的；在另一部分任务上，这是在帮倒忙——复杂模块、团队文档习惯、用户明确要求，都会撞车。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">新写法更像：</p><blockquote class=\"blockquote\" style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">写得像周围的代码：注释密度、命名、习惯都对齐。</strong></p></blockquote><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">一句话，把「禁止清单」换成「跟现场」。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">2）示例 → 接口设计</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">以前教模型用工具，第一定律是：<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">多给 examples。</strong></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">现在他们发现：示例会把探索空间焊死在示例路径上。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">更有效的做法是：想清楚工具参数本身有多「会说话」。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">比如 Todo 工具：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">status</code> 只允许 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">pending / in_progress / completed</code></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 并约定 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">同时只有一项 in_progress</strong></li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">不用长篇示例，模型也能读懂该怎么用。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">少讲故事，多把枚举、约束、接口语义设计对。</strong></p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">3）全塞前面 → 渐进披露</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">早期 Claude Code 系统提示里塞满了 code review、验证流程——不是每次都用到，但一旦用到就很关键。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">现在他们更相信 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">progressive disclosure</strong>：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 验证、评审拆成独立 Skill，需要时再调用</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 部分工具 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">deferred loading</strong>：先搜到定义（如 ToolSearch），再用，避免常驻吃上下文</li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">对应到你自己的仓库：</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">别把 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">CLAUDE.md</code> / <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">SKILL.md</code> 做成「宇宙百科全书」。<br>做成 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">一棵会按需打开的文件树</strong>。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">4）重复叮嘱 → 工具描述写清楚</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">老模型有时对上下文末尾更敏感，于是系统提示里重复提工具，工具 description 里再写一遍。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">新模型上，重复可以砍掉：\\ <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">怎么用工具，写进工具描述；系统提示别再当小抄本。</strong></p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">5）CLAUDE.md 当记忆本 → Auto-memory</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">以前鼓励用 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">#</code> 热键往 CLAUDE.md 记东西。<br>现在 Claude 会自动保存对你、对当前工作有用的记忆。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">CLAUDE.md 该回到本职：<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">仓库地图 + 本地坑</strong>，不是日记本。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">6）简单规格 → 丰富引用</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Plan 模式曾经重度依赖 Markdown 计划文件。<br>现在模型能啃更复杂的引用：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• Artifacts 生成的 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">HTML</strong></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">测试套件</strong> 当规格</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 另一仓库里要移植的 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">真实函数</strong></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Rubrics（评分标准）</strong>：用来启动 verifier agent，对齐「什么叫好的 API 设计」这类品味问题</li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">一句话：\\ <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">能给代码就别只给形容词。</strong></p><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\"><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">三、落到你仓库：四层上下文怎么写</h2><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">System Prompt</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">产品级身份与任务边界。</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 用 Claude Code：你基本 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">不用改</strong></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 自建 agent harness：这里值得花最多时间</li></ul><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">CLAUDE.md</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">保持轻：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 几句话说明 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">这个仓库是干什么的</strong></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 大部分 token 留给 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">仓库特有坑</strong>（例如：类型只能写在某个 monofile，别处禁止）</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">别写「打开文件就能看懂」的废话</strong></li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">细节用渐进披露：验证流程很长？做成 verification skill，再在 CLAUDE.md 里点一下引用。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">Skills</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">把 Skill 想成 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">轻量导航</strong>，不是厚说明书。</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 非关键路径：少硬约束</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 关键路径：可以严一点</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 长 Skill：<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">拆文件</strong>，用到再加载</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 最有价值的内容：你们团队 / 产品 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">特有</strong> 的意见、知识和最佳实践</li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">别人写得出的通用教程，不配占你的 context。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">References</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">用 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">@</code> 把规格、 mockup、整段代码库挂进来。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">优先顺序建议：</p><ol class=\"ol\" style=\"padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">1. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">代码本身</strong>（高保真）</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">2. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">HTML mockup</strong></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">3. 纯文字描述 / 截图</li></ol><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">「做成什么样」用界面和代码说，比形容词准一个量级。</p><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\"><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">四、今晚可执行的精简清单</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">对照 Thariq 的建议，按顺序做：</p><ol class=\"ol\" style=\"padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">1. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">跑一遍</strong> Claude Code 里的 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/doctor</code>（文中也写作 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">claude doctor</code>），给 Skills 与 CLAUDE.md 做 rightsize</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">2. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">搜冲突</strong>：同一仓库里是否同时存在「必须注释 / 禁止注释」这类对冲句</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">3. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">砍通用常识</strong>：能从目录结构和代码读出来的，删</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">4. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">把流程迁出 CLAUDE.md</strong>：评审、验证、发布 → Skill 或 deferred 工具</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">5. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">示例改接口</strong>：工具 description 里用枚举和约束，而不是长 example 堆</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">6. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">记忆搬家</strong>：别再把个人偏好往 CLAUDE.md 塞；交给 auto-memory</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">7. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">规格升级</strong>：重要任务给测试、参考实现或 rubric，而不是再写一篇「请务必优雅」</li></ol><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">如果只记一句：</p><blockquote class=\"blockquote\" style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">上下文工程的新默认值，是减法，不是加法。</strong></p></blockquote><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\"><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">五、和前一代习惯怎么兼容</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">旧习惯不是「错」，是 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">为弱判断力模型买的保险</strong>。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">模型强了之后，保险本身会变成摩擦：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 约束越多，冲突越多</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 冲突越多，模型越要在指令丛林里做二次推理</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 你以为在「更安全」，其实在「更慢、更拧」</li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">所以这次 Anthropic 内部能砍 80% 系统提示还不掉分，不是魔法，是：</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">模型已经会看现场；你还在念 combative 版员工手册。</strong></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">当然——删除不等于放飞：<br>删的是过时硬规矩；保留的是产品边界、安全红线、以及<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">只有你知道的仓库坑</strong>。</p><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\"><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">结尾站队</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">如果你还在给每个模型堆 200 行「永远 / 绝不 / 必须」：</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">先别急着再装 Skill。<br>先删掉互相打架的那几段。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">强模型时代，最好的上下文工程，往往是：少写一点，写对一点，写到用到再展开。</strong></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">你准备先砍哪一类？</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• A：互相矛盾的注释/文档规矩</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• B：塞满「常识」的 CLAUDE.md</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• C：一打开就吃上下文的巨型 Skill</li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">评论区回一个字母就行。</p><hr class=\"hr\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;\">\n    \n  \n    \n  \n    \n  </section>\n  </div>", "contentSourceUrl": "https://x.com/trq212/status/2080710971228918066", "thumbMediaId": "xv9tsA2b6d4MzpARc-AiwJT7ExRDWc9PWWqPR2QJp5meqkWaVQXwgX4A5chJO8rB", "needOpenComment": 1, "onlyFansCanComment": 0, "showCoverPic": 1}]}